---
import PageLayout from '@layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Section from '@components/blocks/Section.astro';
import Sidebar from '@components/blocks/Sidebar.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '@components/structures/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import Content from '@components/blocks/Content.astro';
import { getPageContent } from '@data/pages';
import { getLatestAdvantagesPosts } from '@utils/posts';
import { getLegalPageContent } from '@data/page-content';
import { SUPPORTED_LANGUAGES } from '@/types/i18n';
import type { TocItem } from '@components/structures/TableOfContents.astro';

export function getStaticPaths() {
  return SUPPORTED_LANGUAGES.map((lang) => ({
    params: { lang },
  }));
}

const page = getPageContent('disclaimer', 'en');
const content = getLegalPageContent('disclaimer', 'en');

const chapters = [
  {
    id: 'chapter-1',
    chapter: '1.',
    title: 'NATURE AND PURPOSE OF THE SERVICE',
    content: `
      <p>1.1. Service as a Tool, Not a Guarantor: The Service "Architect of Personal Brands" is provided exclusively as a SaaS (Software as a Service) tool based on artificial intelligence (AI) algorithms and the Author's Methodology. The Service is intended for structuring, analysis and generation of strategic recommendations for Personal Brand development. The "Author's Methodology" is a subjective intellectual product based on the Owner's personal experience. It is not a generally recognized scientific standard or the only correct way of doing business. The User acknowledges that the use of any author's methodology always carries the risk of inefficiency in a specific market situation, and voluntarily chooses to follow this logic.</p>
      <p>1.2. Absence of Consulting Guarantees: The Owner and Author of the Service Sergey Vyacheslavovich P., Business-Tracker does not act as a personal consultant, financial advisor, investment manager or PR specialist. Information and documents generated by the Service are of an exclusively recommendatory and informational nature and are not an individual guarantee of success or a professional opinion.</p>
      <p>1.3. The Owner is not responsible for the quality and accuracy of the output content if it is formed on the basis of incomplete, contradictory or knowingly false data entered by the User (Garbage In — Garbage Out).</p>
    `,
  },
  {
    id: 'chapter-2',
    chapter: '2.',
    title: 'CATEGORICAL DISCLAIMER OF FINANCIAL AND COMMERCIAL WARRANTIES',
    content: `
      <p>2.1. No Financial Guarantee: The Service Owner and Author CATEGORICALLY DO NOT GUARANTEE the User's receipt of any specific or positive financial result, achievement of a certain level of income, recognition, audience growth or success in entrepreneurial activity.</p>
      <p>2.2. User Responsibility: The User confirms and agrees that:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc ml-6 space-y-2 my-2">
        <li>a) Success in creating and monetizing a Personal Brand depends exclusively on the User's individual actions, their entrepreneurial skills, financial investments, market situation, content quality, labor costs and many other external, uncontrollable factors.</li>
        <li>b) The Service provides a plan, but cannot guarantee the execution and result of this plan.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>2.3. Assumption of Risks: The User assumes all risks associated with the use of strategies generated by the Service, including, but not limited to: risks of financial losses, damages, inefficiency of marketing campaigns, negative reaction of the market or audience.</p>
      <p>2.4. Ambassador Disclaimer: The Service Owner categorically is not responsible for any financial guarantees, income statements, promises of success, false or exaggerated information about the Service's capabilities that may be distributed by third parties, including Partners, Ambassadors or other users participating in the Affiliate Program. The User acknowledges that only the official website and the Owner themselves are authorized to provide information about the Service. Any use of proper names, brand names or success cases in Partner marketing materials is for illustrative purposes only and is not a guarantee of repetition of a similar result by the User. Any approval by the Owner (likes, reposts, comments) of Partner content in social networks is of a personal communication nature and is not an official confirmation or guarantee of validity of such Partner's statements. The Owner's official position is set out exclusively in documents posted on the domain https://personal-brand-architect.com.</p>
    `,
  },
  {
    id: 'chapter-3',
    chapter: '3.',
    title: 'LIMITATION OF LIABILITY REITERATED',
    content: `
      <p>3.1. Disclaimer of Liability for Damages: The Service Owner and Author are not liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special or punitive damages, including, but not limited to, lost profits, loss of business reputation or other material or intangible losses that may arise for the User as a result of:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc ml-6 space-y-2 my-2">
        <li>a) The User making decisions based on information received from the Service;</li>
        <li>b) The User's inability to implement the proposed strategy;</li>
        <li>c) Any actions or inaction of third parties, including partners, contractors or competitors.</li>
        <li>d) Errors in the operation of the Service, loss of data or incorrect generation of reports caused by the User's non-compliance with the rules of use, set out in the document "Instruction for Personal Account" (Instruction for using the ALB platform).</li>
      </ul>
      <p>3.2. Maximum Liability: The maximum limit of the Owner's liability, regardless of the basis of the claim (contract, tort, law, etc.), is in any case limited to the amount actually paid by the User for the use of the Service for the period immediately preceding the occurrence of the incident.</p>
      <p>3.3. The User agrees to indemnify the Owner against any claims, lawsuits or fines from third parties arising in connection with the User's use of the Service's work results in the public space. The User is solely responsible for violations of third-party rights, including, but not limited to, Intellectual Property rights.</p>
    `,
  },
  {
    id: 'chapter-4',
    chapter: '4.',
    title: 'DISCLAIMER OF OTHER TYPES OF WARRANTIES',
    content: `
      <p>4.1. AS IS: The Service is provided to the User "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" without any express or implied warranties, including, but not limited to, warranties of fitness for a particular purpose, non-infringement of third-party rights and absence of errors in operation.</p>
      <p>4.2. Accuracy and Completeness: The Owner does not give warranties regarding the accuracy, reliability, timeliness or completeness of information generated by the Service, as it is based on algorithms and data that may be subject to changes and limitations of AI technology. The User acknowledges that AI models are prone to "hallucinations" (generation of factual errors). The Owner is not liable for any direct or indirect damages arising from the User's use of factually unreliable information generated by the Service without its prior verification from independent official sources.</p>
      <p>4.3. Absence of medical and psychological counseling: The Service is not a tool for psychological support, therapy or coaching. The Owner is not responsible for any impact of the use of the Service on the mental health or emotional state of the User.</p>
    `,
  },
  {
    id: 'chapter-5',
    chapter: '5.',
    title: 'USER CONSENT',
    content: `
      <p>5.1. By confirming Acceptance of the Offer, the User confirms that they are aware: The Service is a high-risk tool, the results of the use of which depend entirely on the User's actions. The User uses the Service at their own risk and fully releases the Owner and Author from any financial claims related to the commercial result.</p>
      <p>5.2. User Status (Prosumer): The User confirms and warrants that they are a Prosumer (Business-User) and use the Service exclusively for professional, commercial or other activities aimed at generating profit (forming a personal brand as a commercial asset). The Parties acknowledge that the User uses the Service for purposes not related to personal, family, household and other similar needs. In this regard, consumer protection laws do not apply to the relationship between the Owner and the User (including, but not limited to: rules on unconditional refunds, "cooling off" period and the right to unmotivated termination of the contract). The User confirms that access to the Service is not a vital service (essential service) for them. If the User realizes that they do not possess professional skills to interpret AI data or do not intend to engage in commercial activity, they are obliged to immediately stop using the Service. Continued use of the Service after acceptance is undeniable proof of the User's informed choice of Business-User (Prosumer).</p>
    `,
  },
];

const blogItems = await getLatestAdvantagesPosts('en', 2);
const tocItems: TocItem[] = chapters.map((item) => ({
  id: item.id,
  text: item.title,
  chapter: item.chapter,
}));
---

<PageLayout head={page.meta} hero={page.hero}>
  <Section variant="default">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] gap-8 lg:gap-12">
      <Sidebar
        tocItems={tocItems}
        blogItems={blogItems}
        blogTitle="Useful materials"
        ctaText="Read more"
        class="order-last lg:order-first"
      />
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
        <Breadcrumbs items={[{ text: content.breadcrumb }]} class="mb-6" />
        <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
          <div class="py-4">
            <p>
              <strong
                >DISCLAIMER OF WARRANTIES AND REPRESENTATIONS (DISCLAIMER) of AI-service "Architect of Personal Brands"</strong
              >
            </p>
            <p>Last updated: 20.02.2026</p>
            <p>Effective from: 18.02.2026</p>
            <p>
              <strong>PREAMBLE</strong><br />
              This document "Disclaimer of Warranties and Representations" is a legal instrument delimiting the areas of liability
              between the Service Owner and the User. Purpose of the document: To ensure the User understands that the AI-service
              "Architect of Personal Brands" is a technological tool for creative and analytical work, and not a source of
              guaranteed financial or business results.
            </p>
            <p>This document regulates:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc ml-6 space-y-2 my-2">
              <li>The Owner's disclaimer of liability for any financial losses of the User;</li>
              <li>The User's acknowledgment of the probabilistic nature of artificial intelligence;</li>
              <li>The Owner's release from liability for statements of third parties (Partners/Ambassadors).</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              <strong>IMPORTANT:</strong> Use of the Service without full acceptance of the conditions of this Disclaimer
              is prohibited.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>ATTENTION:</strong> This document is an integral part of the Public Offer Agreement, User Agreement,
              Privacy Policy, Instruction for Personal Account usage, Affiliate Program Terms and Content Usage Rules of the
              Service "Architect of Personal Brands" (hereinafter – the Service). Acceptance of the Offer means that the User
              has read, understood and unconditionally agreed with this Disclaimer of Warranties and Representations.
            </p>
          </div>
          <Content chapters={chapters} />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>
</PageLayout>
